{"id":"96e88157ef117acf","group":"88","path":"88/88-ex-compactness-application.md","title":"Compactness Application: Non-standard Models","display":"ex-compactness-application — Compactness Application: Non-standard Models","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-ex-compactness-application","aliases":["88-ex-compactness-application"],"display":"ex-compactness-application — Compactness Application: Non-standard Models","depends_on":["[[88-thm-compactness]]","[[./88-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[88-df-satisfiable]]","[[88-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-ex-compactness-application"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-ex-compactness-application</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-compactness-application — Compactness Application: Non-standard Models"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e66fa0a2ff4a679f\" href=\"?note=e66fa0a2ff4a679f\" title=\"88-thm-compactness\">88-thm-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"111244cddc854123\" href=\"?note=111244cddc854123\" title=\"./88-df-peano-arithmetic\">88-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"07d05f02304a849d\" href=\"?note=07d05f02304a849d\" title=\"88-df-satisfiable\">88-df-satisfiable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_c\">\\(S_c\\)</span> (the arithmetic signature expanded by a fresh constant <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano arithmetic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"111244cddc854123\" href=\"?note=111244cddc854123\" title=\"./88-df-peano-arithmetic\">88-df-peano-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_c}\">\\(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_c}\\)</span> (the same axiom set read in the expanded signature)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}}\">\\(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}}\\)</span> (the nonstandard-element extension)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_{S_c}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_{S_c}\\)</span> (satisfiability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"07d05f02304a849d\" href=\"?note=07d05f02304a849d\" title=\"88-df-satisfiable\">88-df-satisfiable</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}compactness\\text{-}application} \\vdash\n\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PA},\n\\qquad\n\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\cup\n\\{\\overline n&lt;c:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Sat}_{S_c}(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}compactness\\text{-}application} \\vdash\n\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PA},\n\\qquad\n\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\cup\n\\{\\overline n&lt;c:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Sat}_{S_c}(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ns}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> : 新常量符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span>是标准数词。</li>\n<li>紧致性定理应用 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e66fa0a2ff4a679f\" href=\"?note=e66fa0a2ff4a679f\" title=\"88-thm-compactness\">88-thm-compactness</a>)</li>\n<li>任一有限子集只要求<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>大于有限多个标准数，可由标准模型的适当展开满足。</li>\n<li>因而存在含有大于每个标准数词之元素的非标准算术模型。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-thm-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"e66fa0a2ff4a679f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-thm-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"./88-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"111244cddc854123","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./88-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-satisfiable","status":"resolved","id":"07d05f02304a849d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-satisfiable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"69c0e9e2e8f423a6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"./88-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"111244cddc854123","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}$ (Peano arithmetic, see [[./88-df-peano-arithmetic]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-satisfiable","status":"resolved","id":"07d05f02304a849d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sat}_{S_c}$ (satisfiability predicate, see [[88-df-satisfiable]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"e66fa0a2ff4a679f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"紧致性定理应用 (see [[88-thm-compactness]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S_c","display":f